{"lines":[{"t":"Sample Writing answers","x":0.670423182575142,"y":0.0389838197347121,"w":0.23315366109212243,"h":0.019124337725420326,"c":1},{"x":0.063786004344088904,"h":0.02041560488679528,"c":1,"w":0.35802469889322919,"y":0.08568904645202835,"t":"TEST 2, WRITING TASK 1"},{"w":0.69568471272786458,"h":0.019174515147933668,"t":"This is an answer written by a candidate who achieved a Band 6.0 score.","x":0.063680612237844839,"y":0.12190690122742531,"c":1},{"x":0.061579355119021767,"y":0.14810433653111266,"h":0.023630046732153187,"c":1,"t":"The diagram illustrates the process by which sugar is produced from sugar cane. The process","w":0.78629308064778647},{"t":"consists of seven steps of various time length, starting by farming sugar canes and ending by dry","x":0.061586572059451325,"w":0.81717264811197921,"h":0.023715970653808038,"c":1,"y":0.16899388139140636},{"h":0.021177968091481647,"y":0.18926566688090363,"w":0.16510317484537762,"t":"sugar ready to use.","c":1,"x":0.061481334381436645},{"c":1,"t":"First, sugarcane is farmed and nurished for a period of 12 to 18 months, which is the longest step","w":0.81912333170572915,"h":0.02216986576435287,"x":0.061633441502560234,"y":0.21826083296856869},{"w":0.82328704833984367,"c":1,"t":"in the whole process. Second, sugar cane get harvested by the means of two ways, either manually","x":0.059556711653325274,"y":0.23914592876429563,"h":0.022677182308776578},{"y":0.25983614475691141,"x":0.061663835825415368,"t":"or using specialized vehicles. Third, the harvested sugar cane go through the step of crushing,","c":1,"h":0.022174001722931158,"w":0.79438084920247409},{"x":0.059670777384972527,"y":0.28197674456906263,"w":0.30658437093098961,"h":0.018965540280471371,"c":1,"t":"resulting in liquid torm called juice."},{"t":"The fourth step involves purifying the juice through Limestone filters. The purified juice now goes","w":0.81909372965494787,"c":1,"y":0.30920767517006231,"x":0.059575357758147901,"h":0.023277671373634568},{"c":1,"t":"through the fifth step, which put it under extreme heat to allow it to evaporate to get syrup out","w":0.79858937581380196,"h":0.023344922823956393,"x":0.059539709453388712,"y":0.32859507857754955},{"y":0.35025743371713913,"t":"from it. Then the syrup is centrifuged to separate sugar crystals from syrup. Once that happend","w":0.80263956705729156,"x":0.059575124953461324,"c":1,"h":0.021352862300805464},{"h":0.026065741045876556,"c":1,"y":0.3685397278772794,"w":0.83574951171875,"t":"the sugar is taken into the last phase of drying and cooling, which finalise the process and produce","x":0.059472980401076257},{"x":0.059670771106054399,"y":0.39244186085168398,"h":0.018924452531183356,"c":1,"w":0.4588477579752604,"t":"ready-to-use sugar that is packed and ready for sale."},{"h":0.016341122918190787,"x":0.061596951382206458,"y":0.4270245904042036,"c":1,"t":"Here is the examiner's comment:","w":0.31506551106770836},{"c":1,"w":0.72036753336588544,"t":"There is an overview presented in the first paragraph which summarises the","x":0.10688900802998319,"h":0.019743037588885626,"y":0.46251975195031436},{"t":"process into the farming stages and the drying stages. This summary could be","y":0.48065876302750521,"x":0.10692886645044827,"w":0.74292724609374994,"h":0.019291604786795369,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.1069144978230141,"y":0.49781337964414862,"w":0.74091303507486983,"h":0.020309733558178555,"t":"more detailed, e.g. farming, crushing, separating and drying stages. The ideas"},{"x":0.10691356773371032,"y":0.51616150125690574,"h":0.01900595630155999,"w":0.77590128580729167,"c":1,"t":"are presented in three paragraphs and follow the logical sequence of the process."},{"x":0.10689315712074328,"t":"Cohesive devices are basic [First | Second | Third | fourth] and there is some","y":0.53316091126971199,"w":0.72654657999674477,"h":0.020430217783358406,"c":1},{"t":"repetition, but there is a clear progression.","h":0.017462404653236896,"w":0.40534978230794272,"y":0.55232558122698261,"x":0.10493827736043196,"c":1},{"t":"Spelling is generally accurate and the vocabulary conveys the message well, with","h":0.020357430753494499,"x":0.10685281865533228,"c":1,"w":0.77184758504231776,"y":0.58683052823281967},{"y":0.60467744056870432,"h":0.019582647316868651,"t":"some range [the longest step | specialized vehicles | liquid]. Grammatical range is","x":0.10485677914260606,"w":0.77383010864257817,"c":1},{"y":0.62145918456242999,"c":1,"w":0.75754455566406254,"h":0.021841365962483428,"t":"weaker and there are a number of errors [get harvested \/ is harvested] including","x":0.10478407795357858},{"h":0.019476685001656446,"x":0.10480992943341477,"y":0.64047770190590281,"w":0.57432301839192701,"t":"third-person endings [go through \/ goes through | put \/ puts].","c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.019159546168027397,"y":0.67565654270127573,"t":"This response could be improved by a more detailed overview and more accuracy","x":0.10689523376914631,"w":0.77592264811197909},{"t":"in grammatical structures.","y":0.69399244856746967,"x":0.10270654309074871,"w":0.25140614827473956,"c":1,"h":0.016832574096248276},{"t":"133","c":1,"x":0.85802469223353839,"h":0.013081395583944722,"w":0.039094648361206019,"y":0.91424418586949696}],"w":2400,"h":3396}